  - m_Id: 837296118030336
    m_Localized: 'Whoa, I have a <color=#FFD54F>WEAPON!</color>

      Press the
      <color=#55D6FF>aim button</color>

      and show the enemies what I can do!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839118824136704
    m_Localized: '<color=#69F0AE>HOORAY!</color> A new level!

      I''m getting
      <color=#FFD54F>STRONGER</color>, and my health has increased! All right, bring
      it on!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839156904222720
    m_Localized: "<color=#59FF56>New Level</color>\t\t<color=#FF383A>Health</color>
      increased"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839716055277568
    m_Localized: 'Wow! Look at these <color=#FFD54F>TROPHIES!</color>   <sprite name="Cup">

      I''ll
      save them up to buy

      a <color=#55D6FF>NEW WEAPON!</color>

      I want
      a cooler gun!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 839856627376128
    m_Localized: 'Awesome! I get <color=#FFD54F>POINTS!</color>   <sprite name="Score">

      for
      every shot!

      The more I shoot,

      the closer I get to a <color=#69F0AE>NEW
      LEVEL!</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 840990880423936
    m_Localized: 'Yes! <color=#FFD54F>CROWNS!</color> <sprite name="Crown">

      I
      destroy enemies and obstacles, collect crowns, and climb <color=#55D6FF>THE
      LEADERBOARD!</color>

      Now that''s a royal job!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
